<title>USA: TABLE - Newport News Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Newport News Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter   1st Half</p>
<p>				     1997     1996    1997   1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $450    $477    $853   $915</p>
<p> Net Earnings			 14	18	27     37</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     0.39     N/A    0.77    N/A</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares	34.8	--    34.6     --</p>
<p>		(Dollars in Millions, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Newport News Shipbuilding said its net income includes 1996 includes interest allocated by Tenneco Inc, the company's former parent.</p>
<p>Newport News did not report earnings per share for 1996 because Tenneco only completed the spinoff of Newport News in December 1996.</p>
